000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          CSWITCHF.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        4/3/87.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.    THIS SUBPROGRAM SWITCHES FROM AN OLD FORMFILE TO A NEW
001000*            FORMFILE, THEN BACK TO THE OLD FORMFILE.  THIS
001100*            SUBPROGRAM WILL AVOID THE 2 VIEW ERRORS WE GET WHEN
001200*            SWITCHING BETWEEN FORMFILES:
001300*                VIEW ERROR 40 - NOT ENOUGH DL AREA.  THIS IS
001400*                                FIXED WITH THE "ZLSIZE"
001500*                                INTRINSIC TO SHRINK STACK.
001600*                VIEW ERROR 4  - NOT SURE WHAT CAUSES IT.
001700*                                DATACOM ERROR?  SUBPROG ATTEMPTS
001800*                                6 RETRIES.
001900*
002000*
002100*  NOTE| - MAKE SURE YOUR 'FORMFILE' PARAMETER HAS THE FOLLOWING
002200*  FORMAT:
002300*  01  FORMFILE.
002400*      05  FORM-NAME       PIC X(8) VALUE "FNAME".  **MUST BE X(8)**
002500*      05  FILLER          PIC X(1) VALUE ".".
002600*      05  FORM-GNAME.
002700*          10  FORM-GNAME1 PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
002800*          10  FORM-GNAME2 PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
002900*      05  FILLER          PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
003000*
003100*  DON'T WORRY THAT THE NAME ISN'T 8 IN LENGTH - THE SUBPROGRAM WILL
003200*  COMPRESS THE NAME ELIMINATING SPACES.
003300*
003400*  PARAMETERS:
003500*     CSF-MODE                PASSED:
003600*                             N = SWITCH TO NEW FORMFILE
003700*                             O = SWITCH BACK TO OLD FORMFILE
003800*                                 ('VGETNEXTFORM' WILL BE DONE
003900*                                 ON OLD FORM)
004000*
004100*    CSF-CLOSE-FORMFILE-FLAG  PASSED (MODE 'O' ONLY):
004200*                             Y = CLOSE FORMFILE WHEN SWITCHING
004300*                                 TO OLD FORM
004400*                             N = SKIP CLOSE OF FORMFILE WHEN
004500*                                 SWITCHING TO OLD FORM - IF
004600*                                 FORMFILE IS ALREADY CLOSED,
004700*                                 SUCH AS WHEN CALLING "SRSCRNS",
004800*                                 WHICH CLOSES FORMFILE TO STREAM
004900*                                 A JOB.
005000*                             NOTE: THIS IS RETURNED TO "Y" ON EACH
005100*                             CALL.
005200*
005300*    CSF-FIRST-OPENFORMF-FLAG PASSED:
005400*                             Y = OPENING A FORMFILE FOR 1ST TIME
005500*                             N = NOT OPENING FORMFILE FOR 1ST TIME
005600*                             NOTE: THIS IS RETURNED TO "N" ON EACH
005700*                             CALL.
005800*
005900*    CSF-OPENFORM-ERR-SW      RETURNED:
006000*                             Y = IS RETURNED IF NEW FORMFILE
006100*                                 IS UNABLE TO BE OPENED.
006200*                                 SUBPROG WILL GIVE ERR MSG,
006300*                                 CALLING PROGRAM CAN GO BACK TO
006400*                                 SHOWFORM
006500*                             N = NEW FORMFILE OPEN SUCCESSFUL
006600*
006700*    CSF-SAVE-FORM            RETURNED:
006800*                             NAME OF CURRENT FORMFILE WHEN NEW
006900*                             FORM IS OPENED.  THIS IS JUST SO THAT
007000*                             THE SUBPROG CAN RE-GET THAT FORM WHEN
007100*                             GOING BACK TO OLD FORMFILE.
007200*
007300
007400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
007500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
007600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
007700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
007800
007900 DATA DIVISION.
008000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
008100
       01  SAVE-FORM                     PIC X(16).

012900**************************************************************
013000**                                                          **
013100**                L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N             **
013200**                                                          **
013300**************************************************************
013400
013500 LINKAGE SECTION.
013600
013700 COPY VCOMLINK   IN COPYCSIS.
013800 COPY LANGSUB    IN COPYCSIS.
013900 01  CSF-OLD-FORMFILE.
014000     05  CSF-OLD-FORMFILE-NAME     PIC X(8).
014100     05  FILLER                    PIC X(28).
014200 COPY CSWITCHF   IN COPYCSIS.
014300 01  BU-DISPLAY-MSG                PIC X(60).
014400
014500
014600 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING          VIEW-COMAREA,
014700                                   LANGUAGE-PARMS,
014800                                   CSF-OLD-FORMFILE,
014900                                   CSF-PARMS,
015000                                   BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
015100
015200 6-MAIN.
015300*------ POSSIBILITIES:
015400*-------   1.  SWITCH TO A NEW FORMFILE PRECEEDING CALL TO A
015500*-------       SUBPROGRAM.  (SUCH AS AN INQUIRY).
015600*-------   2.  SWITCH TO OLD FORMFILE, BUT DONT CLOSE NEW
015700*-------       FORMFILE FIRST (WHEN THE NEW FORMFILE WAS CLOSED
015800*-------       ALREADY, SUCH AS WHEN STREAMING A JOB ONLINE).
015900*-------   3.  OPEN A FORMFILE FOR THE FIRST TIME.  (THIS
016000*-------       GIVES THE 6 RETRIES).
016100*-------   4.  SWITCHING FROM THE NEW FORMFILE THE SUBPROGRAM
016200*-------       NEEDED BACK TO THE OLD FORMFILE.  ALSO, THE OLD
016300*-------       FORM IS RE-GOTTEN
016400
016500     IF CSF-MODE = "N"
016600         PERFORM 6100-SWITCH-NEW-FORMFILE THRU 6190-SNF-X
016700     ELSE
016800     IF CSF-CLOSE-FORMFILE-FLAG = "N"
016900         PERFORM 6300-SWITCH-OLD-FORMFILE THRU 6390-SOF-X
017000     ELSE
017100     IF CSF-FIRST-OPENFORMF-FLAG = "Y"
017200         PERFORM 6100-SWITCH-NEW-FORMFILE THRU 6190-SNF-X
017300     ELSE
017400         PERFORM 6300-SWITCH-OLD-FORMFILE THRU 6390-SOF-X.
017500
017600*------- RETURN FLAGS TO DEFAULT STATUS (SO CALLING PROGRAM
017700*------- HAS TO MOVE VALUES TO THE FLAGS ONLY ON 'SPECIAL'
017800*------- CALLS).
017900     MOVE "Y"                      TO   CSF-CLOSE-FORMFILE-FLAG.
018000     MOVE "N"                      TO   CSF-FIRST-OPENFORMF-FLAG.
           MOVE "N"                      TO   CSF-OPENFORM-ERR-SW.
018100     GOBACK.
018200
018300 6100-SWITCH-NEW-FORMFILE.
           MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO SAVE-FORM.
022000 6190-SNF-X.
022100     EXIT.
022200
022300 6300-SWITCH-OLD-FORMFILE.
           MOVE SAVE-FORM TO VIEW-NFNAME.
027600 6390-SOF-X.
027700     EXIT.
